# Token Calculator

Purpose:
  Estimate and record token usage per chain stage.

Estimation:
  prompt: ~1200 in, ~3400 out
  docs: ~3400 in, ~8200 out
  sdd: ~8200 in, ~12100 out
  code: ~12100 in, ~35400 out
  review: ~35400 in, ~36100 out
  deploy: ~36100 in, ~36500 out

Optimization:
  - Use short node IDs (2-6 chars)
  - Use indexes instead of full file reads
  - Lazy load skills
  - Cache resolved references
  - Minimize context duplication
Tracking:

  File: .sdd/projects/vkard.az/tokens/{node}.sdd
  Fields:
    stage
    run_id
    timestamp
    tokens_in
    tokens_out
    tokens_delta
    status
    parent
    duration_ms
    retry_count
     error

State: +
